const sections=[["Set the table","Choose a level table with room for four racks, tiles and drinks kept safely away from play. Give everyone a clearly lit seat."],["Choose one ruleset","American, Chinese regional and Japanese riichi Mahjong are not interchangeable. Pick the variation before inviting beginners and prepare the correct reference material."],["Make first-timers comfortable","Share a two-minute explanation of the goal, agree to pause for questions, and let everyone keep a quick reference sheet nearby."],["Bring snacks and a little personality","Easy finger food, tea, cheerful napkins and a playlist can make the gathering feel special. Keep food and liquids away from the tiles."],["Make it a tradition","Choose a recurring date and keep the atmosphere welcoming. A fun evening is more important than a perfect score."]];
